<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Quintile upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Quintile upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it upgraded Quintile Transnational Corp to strong buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 2-15/16 to 53-5/16.</p>
</text>
